OL,3,ACalifornians reject wealth tax for
OL,4,Abillionaires
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalifornia voters have voted to reject
OL,7,Fa wealth tax on its billionaires.
OL,9,FThe ballot proposal would have levied a
OL,10,Fone-time tax on the state's mega
OL,11,Fwealthy to help fund healthcare. It
OL,12,Ftook nearly a week of counting votes
OL,13,Fafter the midterm election to determine
OL,14,Fa projection on the measure.
OL,16,FThere are about 200 billionaires in the
OL,17,Fstate, including Meta's Mark
OL,18,FZuckerberg, reality television star Kim
OL,19,FKardashian and media mogul Oprah
OL,20,FWinfrey.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
