OL,3,ACalifornians reject wealth tax for
OL,4,Abillionaires
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposition 40 targeted Californians
OL,7,Fwith a wealth of more than $1.1bn
OL,8,F(#800m) with a 5% tax on their total
OL,9,Fwealth, including assets such as shares
OL,10,Fas well as income. It failed amid
OL,11,Fdivisions among Democrats and labour
OL,12,Funions.
